flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Read current user ID from session]
    B --> C{Session user ID present?}
    C -- No --> D[Show no active session error]
    C -- Yes --> E[Call Client.viewAccountInfo]
    E --> F[Clear table model]
    F --> G[Loop through account strings]
    G --> H[Split account string into number and balance]
    H --> I{Split has 2 parts?}
    I -- Yes --> J[Add row to table]
    I -- No --> K[Skip row]
    J --> L{More accounts?}
    K --> L
    L -- Yes --> G
    L -- No --> M[End]
    D --> M
